  "summary": "Hosts ComfyUI and other image-generation apps on machines rented by the hour, billed from the moment the machine is ready until it is stopped, paid from an added balance. The figure is the whole machine, with its RAM and the app workspace. Its cheaper Bargain tier can be interrupted when demand rises and is listed as spot. The page prices in US dollars and names no region; it says nothing about VAT. Machines it lists as \"L4•A10\" are not listed here, since the page does not say which of the two cards a renter gets.",
